{"code":"200","msg":"Success","data":{"indexFullNameCn":"中证国新港股通央企红利指数","indexShortNameCn":"国新港股通央企红利","indexFullNameEn":"CSI China Reform Hong Kong Connect Central-SOEs High Dividend Yield Index","indexShortNameEn":"China Reform HKC Central-SOEs High Dividend","indexCode":"931722","ric":null,"bloombergid":null,"basicDate":"2016-12-30","basicIndex":1000.000,"publishDate":"2023-09-13","publishChannelCn":"数据服务平台","publishChannelEn":"数据服务平台","consNumber":null,"adjFreqCn":"每年","adjFreqEn":"Annually","currencyCn":"港元","currencyEn":"HKD","indexType":"stock","indexCnDesc":"中证国新港股通央企红利指数由国新投资有限公司定制，从港股通范围内选取国务院国资委央企名录中分红水平稳定且股息率较高的上市公司证券作为指数样本，以反映港股通范围内股息率较高的央企上市公司证券的整体表现。","indexEnDesc":"CSI China Reform Hong Kong Connect Central-SOEs High Dividend Yield Index is customized by China Reform Consulting Corporation Ltd. It selects the securities affiliated to the State-owned Assets Supervision and Administration Commission of the State Council (SASAC), with stable dividend and high dividend yield from the securities eligible for trading via Hong Kong Stock Connect as the index constituents. The index is to reflect the overall performance of securities of listed securities affiliated to SASAC with high dividend yields under Hong Kong Stock Connect.","weightingType":null,"weightingTypeEn":null,"ifWeightCapped":null,"ifWeightCappedEn":null,"indexCompliance":"无","ifProtect":false,"protectStartDate":null,"protectEndDate":null,"protectCnDesc":null},"success":true}